    "customer_notice_days": 7,
    "scope": "all_incidents",
    "during_investigation_required": true,
    "phase_in_months": 0,
    "quote": "Manufacturers must report every thermal incident involving overheating, fire, or suspected thermal runaway to the relevant regulator within 72 hours of becoming aware of it, including incidents still under investigation. Manufacturers must notify affected customers within 5 business days when an incident presents a credible safety risk to their unit or requires customer action."
